ction-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"c14b01f","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"124e6b1","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-124e6b1","attrs":{"data-id":"124e6b1","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"5535d30","wtype":"heading.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-5535d30 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading","attrs":{"data-id":"5535d30","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"heading.default"},"heading":{"tag":"h2","cls":"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default","attrs":{},"html":"Faq"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"7a72f07","wtype":"divider.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-7a72f07 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider","attrs":{"data-id":"7a72f07","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"divider.default"},"html":"<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n</span>\n</div>"},{"_type":"widget","_key":"f0fb63b","wtype":"accordion.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-f0fb63b faq-wrapper elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion","attrs":{"data-id":"f0fb63b","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"accordion.default"},"html":"<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2521\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2521\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Are your facilities handicap accessible?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2521\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2521\" role=\"region\"><p>King Spa is committed to providing an inclusive experience for all our guests. We provide elevator access to all three floors of our spa. If you have specific needs or require additional assistance during your visit, please let our staff know, and we will be happy to accommodate you as best we can.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2522\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2522\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What is it like to visit a Korean spa (jimjilbang)?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2522\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2522\" role=\"region\"><p>Visiting a Korean spa, or jimjilbang, is a cultural experience focused on relaxation, socialization, and wellness. In the gender-segregated bathhouses, nudity is standard, and guests often walk around the locker rooms freely with little concern for modesty. This openness can be surprising for newcomers but is considered completely normal in a Korean spa setting. Small towels are provided but are mainly used for washing or covering the head, not the body. Keep in mind that visiting the nude bathhouse is optional and not required.</p><p>The atmosphere in a Korean spa is social and community-focused, with guests moving between saunas, lounges, the bathhouse, and relaxation areas. Families and friends often spend hours enjoying the amenities together.</p><p>Visiting a jimjilbang requires an open mind, but embracing the experience offers a deeper appreciation of Korean wellness culture.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2523\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2523\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Is nudity required at King Spa?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2523\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2523\" role=\"region\"><p>Nudity is only required in the gender-segregated bathhouses in the men’s and women’s locker rooms. Visiting this part of the spa is optional and not required. Comfortable spa uniforms are provided during your visit while you explore our other spa facilities.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2524\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2524\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What does my day pass include? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2524\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2524\" role=\"region\"><p><strong>Your daily admission pass includes access to: </strong></p><ul><li>Locker Room &amp; Steam Rooms</li><li>Saunas &amp; Base Rock Room</li><li>Outdoor &amp; Indoor Bade Pools</li><li>Jacuzzis &amp; Cold Plunge Pool</li><li>Media Room &amp; Indoor Lounges</li></ul><p><strong>Your pass also includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Spa uniforms (all sizes available. Must be worn during your visit)</li><li>Complimentary toiletries</li><li>Towels</li><li>Shampoo/conditioner/soap</li></ul><p><strong>Please Note:</strong></p><ul><li>Remember to bring your bathing suit if you plan to visit our outdoor or indoor bade pools (you cannot enter these pools without appropriate swimwear).</li><li>Spa treatments, products, food &amp; beverages are available for an additional fee</li><li>You cannot leave our facility once you have entered. Please remember to bring all your belongings with you BEFORE entering the spa.</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2525\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"5\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2525\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What do I need to bring for my spa day at King Spa Virginia? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2525\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2525\" role=\"region\"><ul><li>Valid government issued photo ID (pictures of ID’s and foreign driver’s licenses will not be accepted)</li><li>Swimsuit (Cotton &amp; denim swimwear are not allowed in the water)</li><li>(Swimsuits are available for purchase in the Locker Rooms.)</li><li>Spa lounge uniforms &amp; towels are provided during your stay at King Spa Virginia. </li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2526\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"6\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2526\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What type of Identification will King Spa accept?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2526\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2526\" role=\"region\"><p>King Spa accepts the following forms of identification to enter our facility:</p><ul><li>A valid driver’s license issued by any state in the United States or the District of Columbia</li><li>Armed forces identification card</li><li>U.S. passport or foreign government passport</li><li>Valid special identification card issued by the Virginia Department of Motor Vehicles; or</li><li>Any valid identification issued by any other federal or state government agency, excluding student university and college identification cards.</li></ul><p>Forms of Identification NOT acceptable:</p><ul><li>Expired identification</li><li>Foreign or international driver’s license</li><li>Photo of identification document (you must present a physical copy)</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2527\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"7\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2527\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Do I need a reservation to visit King Spa Virginia? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2527\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2527\" role=\"region\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No, you don’t need an appointment to visit King Spa and enjoy our facilities like saunas, pools, and relaxation areas. However, appointments are required for treatments and must be made on-site on a first-come, first-served basis.</span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2528\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"8\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2528\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What is the price of admission? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2528\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2528\" role=\"region\"><p>To see our current admission fees, please click on “Buy Day Pass.” Prices are subject to change. Please note that some holidays that fall on a weekday will require a weekend rate. To see which holidays require the weekend rate, please see the list of holidays in the following question. Admission does not include treatments, products, food and beverages.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2529\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"9\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-2529\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Which holidays are considered peak?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2529\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"9\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-2529\" role=\"region\"><p>The holidays listed below are considered peak visiting times and guests will be charged the “weekend/holiday” rate to enter. Please see current admission pricing here: <a href=\"/day-pass/\">https://virginia.kingspa.com/day-pass/</a></p><ul><li>New Years Eve</li><li>New Years Day</li><li>MLK Day</li><li>Memorial Day (Monday)</li><li>Labor Day (Monday)</li><li>Juneteenth</li><li>Independence Day</li><li>Christmas Eve</li><li>Christmas Day</li><li>Thanksgiving Weekend (Thurs &amp; Fri)</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25210\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"10\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25210\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Are children allowed at King Spa Virginia? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25210\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"10\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25210\" role=\"region\"><div dir=\"auto\">Children under the age of 12 are not permitted under any circumstances. Minors under 18 years old must be accompanied by an adult 21+ years old and of the same gender. A maximum of 3 children per adult of the same gender are permitted. </div><div dir=\"auto\"> </div><div dir=\"auto\">Minors will need a school ID or copy of birth certificate.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25211\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"11\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25211\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What are your hours? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25211\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"11\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25211\" role=\"region\"><p>King Spa is open 365 days a year, including holidays.</p><p><b>King Spa’s hours of operation:</b></p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sunday – Thursday 9AM to 11PM</span></li><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Friday &amp; Saturday 9AM to 12AM</span></li></ul><p><b>Outdoor pool hours: </b></p><ul><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sunday – Thursday 10 AM – 10 PM</span></li><li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Friday – Saturday 10 AM –  11 PM</span></li></ul><p><em>Doors will close promptly at closing time, so we kindly ask that you plan to exit the building by then.</em></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25212\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"12\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25212\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Can I get a tour of the facility? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25212\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"12\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25212\" role=\"region\"><p>We do not currently offer physical tours of our facility, but you can see a virtual tour here:</p><p></p><div class=\"ast-oembed-container\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"675\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/13O6QxGLTRs?feature=oembed\" title=\"About King Spa Virginia #spa #facials #massage\" width=\"1200\"></iframe></div><p></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25213\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"13\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25213\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Do you offer group rates or party packages? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25213\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"13\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25213\" role=\"region\"><p>We currently do not offer any group discounts or packages. </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25214\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"14\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25214\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Can I visit King Spa Virginia if I am pregnant? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25214\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"14\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25214\" role=\"region\"><p>We recommend that you do not visit any spas while you are pregnant.  Our pools and rooms vary in heat from 94-200 degrees and it is not recommended for pregnant women. </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25215\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"15\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25215\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What is the shoe and footwear policy? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25215\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"15\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25215\" role=\"region\"><p>King Spa Virginia is a barefoot facility. Sandals and slippers are prohibited as well. You may wear clean socks. </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25216\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"16\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25216\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What is the dress code policy? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25216\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"16\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25216\" role=\"region\"><p>King Spa provides spa uniforms during your visit. Outside clothing is prohibited inside our spa and nudity is required in our gender-segregated bathhouse/shower area.</p><p>Swimsuits made of polyester, nylon or spandex are allowed in the Bade Pools and outdoor jacuzzis.  Cotton, denim and other street clothing are not permitted in the pools. </p><p>G-Strings and thongs are also not allowed in the facility. </p><p>Blankets and pillows are not permitted inside the facility. </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25217\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"17\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25217\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What is your policy on alcohol and smoking? </a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25217\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"17\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25217\" role=\"region\"><p>We are a smoke-free, alcohol-free and drug-free facility. Drinking, smoking or using drugs will result in immediate ejection from the facility without a refund.  Drinking prior to entry will also result in ejection without a refund. </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25218\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"18\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25218\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Can I bring my own food or beverages?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25218\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"18\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25218\" role=\"region\"><p>No outside food or beverages will be allowed under any circumstances.  We have a full restaurant and drink bar inside the facility for purchase. </p><p>Do you have any promotions or sales? </p><p>We currently do not offer any promotions or sales. Please check back periodically or you can enter your email for updates or like us on Facebook &amp; Instagram. </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25219\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"19\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25219\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Do the outdoor pools ever close?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25219\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"19\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25219\" role=\"region\"><p>Yes, if the weather gets too cold or there is lightning/thunder, all outdoor pools will be closed for guest safety.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><em>*Rain checks or refunds will not be given for any</em> closures made by King Spa.</span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25220\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"20\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25220\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What are the outdoor pool hours?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25220\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"20\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25220\" role=\"region\"><div>Outdoor pool hours are the following: </div><ul><li>Sunday – Thursday 10 AM – 10 PM</li><li>Friday – Saturday 10 AM –  11 PM</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25221\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"21\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25221\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">I lost an item, do you have a lost and found?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25221\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"21\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25221\" role=\"region\"><p>Abandoned items are held for 2 weeks at our location. King Spa is not responsible for any items lost in the lost and found.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25222\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"22\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25222\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What type of spa treatments are available at King Spa?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25222\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"22\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25222\" role=\"region\"><p>We offer many relaxing and rejuvenating spa treatments for men, women, and couples at King Spa, including massages, facials, body scrubs, V-steams, and more. <a href=\"/treatments/\">Explore King Spa’s luxurious spa treatments</a> and book yours when you visit us. All treatments are booked on-site and are first-come, first-served.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-25223\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"23\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-25223\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">What is your refund policy?</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-25223\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"23\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-25223\" role=\"region\"><p>To see our refund policy, please visit our <a href=\"/about/policies/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Policies </a>page.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"}]}],"nav":{"menu-item-17792":{"cls":"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom current-menu-ancestor current-menu-parent menu-item-has-children parent hfe-has-submenu hfe-creative-menu","ariaCurrent":null},"menu-item-17793":{"cls":"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current-page-ancestor current-page-parent hfe-creative-menu","ariaCurrent":null},"menu-item-17796":{"cls":"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current-menu-item page_item page-item-825 current_page_item hfe-creative-menu","ariaCurrent":null,"linkActive":true}}}